@startuml 12-sequence-retour
' UML sequence diagram: a Retour, with the mandatory client signature or the stored one (US-070 to US-076, US-044).
!include style.iuml
hide footbox
autonumber "<b>0."

actor "Staff" as staff
actor "Client" as client
participant "App\n(iPhone)" as app
participant "API +\nPostgreSQL" as api
participant "Storage" as st

== Open the rental · US-070 ==
staff -> app : « Retour », choose the active rental
app -> api : load the contract as last amended, departure data, open damage
api --> app : data + photo links (≤ 5 min)

opt client can't wait, stored signature switched on (F-28, US-076)
  app -> client : authorisation text (contract language) + signature pad
  client -> app : draws once
  app -> api : drawing
  api -> api : authorisation page stamped and sealed\nstored signature « pending », this Retour only
  api -> st : store the drawing and the sealed authorisation
end

== Check-in · US-071 to US-073 ==
staff -> app : return time, km in, fuel in
app -> app : km driven, extra km
alt new damage
  loop each new damage
    staff -> app : at least one photo + a comment\n+ optional estimate, indicative or billed (F-24)
    app -> st : upload the photos (insert-only, presigned)
    app -> api : save as open damage, linked to this Retour
  end
else nothing new
  staff -> app : « RAS »
end
staff -> app : final pricing lines, typed by hand\n(« Dommages » = billed estimates; warning above the deductible)
app -> api : Retour saved as it is typed (in progress)

== Signature, mandatory · US-074 to US-076 ==
app -> api : preview of the final PDF, FR or EN (switchable)
api -> api : render: new damage first, damage already present in an annex,\ndeparture drawing in « Signature départ »
opt the client disagrees (F-26, US-058)
  staff -> app : new damage, photos or estimate
  app -> api : new preview
end
alt client present
  app -> client : signature pad
  client -> app : draws once (F-17)
  app -> api : drawing · preview ID + SHA-256
else stored signature pending
  staff -> app : « Apposer la signature enregistrée »
  app -> api : apply the stored signature · preview ID + SHA-256
else client absent, nothing stored
  app -> staff : « Retour en attente de signature »
  note right of app : The contract stays active and the car « En cours ».\nThe company contacts the client (B-08);\nthe Retour ends when they sign.
end
activate api #F6EFDC
api -> api : stamp « Signature retour » on every page\n(+ authorisation page if stored) · certificate page · PAdES seal + timestamp
api -> st : store the sealed final PDF, SHA-256
api -> api : one transaction (complete_return):\ninspection · final amounts · signature evidence\n(stored signature → applied) · car km and fuel\ncontract closed · car available · audit
deactivate api
app -> st : download the sealed PDF
app -> staff : iOS share sheet
@enduml
